# GrokSpot: key layout for the Echo Spot PMIC keypad (input device "mtk-kpd",
# vendor 0x2454, product 0x6500). Installed to /data/system/devices/keylayout/.
#
# The top "microphone off" button reports KEY_POWER on this LineageOS port.
# It is remapped to BUTTON_1 so the GrokSpot app receives it as the Grok
# button (short press: talk, 3 s hold: power menu). WAKE lets it wake the
# screen like the power key did.
#
# This file replaces Generic.kl for this device only, so it repeats the
# other keys the keypad reports. To undo: delete this file and reboot.

key 114   VOLUME_DOWN
key 116   BUTTON_1          WAKE
